smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6743322Z <                 <li>perf: replace regular expression with substring</li>
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6743648Z <                 </ul>
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6743856Z <                 <h2>1.8.0</h2>
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6744076Z <                 <ul>
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6744323Z <                 <li>Use SHA1 instead of MD5 for ETag hashing
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6744617Z <                 <ul>
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6744880Z <                 <li>Improves performance for larger entities</li>
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6745256Z <                 <li>Works with FIPS 140-2 OpenSSL configuration</li>
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6745563Z <                 </ul>
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6745765Z <                 </li>
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6745960Z <                 </ul>
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6746160Z <                 <h2>1.7.0</h2>
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6746384Z <                 <ul>
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6746722Z <                 <li>Always include entity length in ETags for hash length extensions</li>
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6747363Z <                 <li>Generate non-Stats ETags using MD5 only (no longer CRC32)</li>
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6747808Z <                 <li>Improve stat performance by removing hashing</li>
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6748203Z <                 <li>Remove base64 padding in ETags to shorten</li>
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6748584Z <                 <li>Use MD5 instead of MD4 in weak ETags over 1KB</li>
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6748903Z <                 </ul>
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6749107Z <                 <h2>1.6.0</h2>
