smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6749565Z <                 <li>Improve support for JXcore</li>
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6749968Z <                 <li>Remove requirement of <code>atime</code> in the stats object</li>
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6750534Z <                 <li>Support &quot;fake&quot; stats objects in environments without <code>fs</code></li>
smoke (npm-yarn)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:28.6751082Z <                 </ul>
