smoke (rust-toolchain-major-minor)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:54:19.4429990Z <                 This feature allows <code>&amp;&amp;</code>-chaining <code>let</code> statements inside <code>if</code> and <code>while</code>, allowing intermixture with boolean expressions. The patterns inside the <code>let</code> sub-expressions can be irrefutable or refutable.</li>
