smoke (python-pip)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:56:19.8611217Z <                 <p>This is a walkthrough of the NumPy 2.4.0 release on Linux, which will be the
smoke (python-pip)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:56:19.8611859Z <                 first feature release using the <code>numpy/numpy-release &lt;https://github.com/numpy/numpy-release&gt;</code>__ repository.</p>
smoke (python-pip)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:56:19.8612440Z <                 <p>The commands can be copied into the command line, but be sure to replace 2.4.0
smoke (python-pip)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:56:19.8612891Z <                 with the correct version. This should be read together with the
smoke (python-pip)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:56:19.8613389Z <                 :ref:<code>general release guide &lt;prepare_release&gt;</code>.</p>
smoke (python-pip)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:56:19.8613759Z <                 <h1>Facility preparation</h1>
smoke (python-pip)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:56:19.8614415Z <                 <p>Before beginning to make a release, use the <code>requirements/*_requirements.txt</code> files to
smoke (python-pip)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:56:19.8614938Z <                 ensure that you have the needed software. Most software can be installed with
smoke (python-pip)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:56:19.8615398Z <                 pip, but some will require apt-get, dnf, or whatever your system uses for
smoke (python-pip)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:56:19.8615939Z <                 software. You will also need a GitHub personal access token (PAT) to push the
smoke (python-pip)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:56:19.8616374Z <                 documentation. There are a few ways to streamline things:</p>
smoke (python-pip)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:56:19.8616752Z <                 <ul>
smoke (python-pip)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:56:19.8617115Z <                 <li>Git can be set up to use a keyring to store your GitHub personal access token.
smoke (python-pip)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:56:19.8617518Z <                 Search online for the details.</li>
smoke (python-pip)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:56:19.8618079Z <                 </ul>
smoke (python-pip)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:56:19.8618335Z <                 <h1>Prior to release</h1>
smoke (python-pip)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:56:19.8618677Z <                 <h2>Add/drop Python versions</h2>
smoke (python-pip)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:56:19.8619090Z <                 <p>When adding or dropping Python versions, multiple config and CI files need to
smoke (python-pip)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:56:19.8619581Z <                 be edited in addition to changing the minimum version in <code>pyproject.toml</code>.
smoke (python-pip)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:56:19.8620102Z <                 Make these changes in an ordinary PR against main and backport if necessary.
