smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.7477729Z -                <ul>
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.7478124Z -                <li>Fixed an issue where setting <code>verify=False</code> on the first request from a
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.7478734Z -                Session will cause subsequent requests to the <em>same origin</em> to also ignore
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.7479289Z -                cert verification, regardless of the value of <code>verify</code>.
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.7480166Z -                (<a href="https://github.com/psf/requests/security/advisories/GHSA-9wx4-h78v-vm56">https://github.com/psf/requests/security/advisories/GHSA-9wx4-h78v-vm56</a>)</li>
