smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.7481782Z -                <li><code>verify=True</code> now reuses a global SSLContext which should improve
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.7482330Z -                request time variance between first and subsequent requests. It should
