smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.7483550Z -                version built with OpenSSL 3.x. (<a href="https://redirect.github.com/psf/requests/issues/6667">#6667</a>)</li>
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.7484299Z -                <li>Requests now supports optional use of character detection
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.7484843Z -                (<code>chardet</code> or <code>charset_normalizer</code>) when repackaged or vendored.
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.7485640Z -                This enables <code>pip</code> and other projects to minimize their vendoring
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.7486235Z -                surface area. The <code>Response.text()</code> and <code>apparent_encoding</code> APIs
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.7487047Z -                will default to <code>utf-8</code> if neither library is present. (<a href="https://redirect.github.com/psf/requests/issues/6702">#6702</a>)</li>
