smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8195814Z <                 <p>To provide a more stable migration for custom HTTPAdapters impacted
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8196345Z <                 by the CVE changes in 2.32.0, we've renamed <code>_get_connection</code> to
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8196886Z <                 a new public API, <code>get_connection_with_tls_context</code>. Existing custom
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8197411Z <                 HTTPAdapters will need to migrate their code to use this new API.
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8198002Z <                 <code>get_connection</code> is considered deprecated in all versions of Requests&gt;=2.32.0.</p>
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8198599Z <                 <p>A minimal (2-line) example has been provided in the linked PR to ease
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8199133Z <                 migration, but we strongly urge users to evaluate if their custom adapter
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8199884Z <                 is subject to the same issue described in CVE-2024-35195. (<a href="https://redirect.github.com/psf/requests/issues/6710">#6710</a>)</p>
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8200469Z <                 </li>
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8200677Z <                 </ul>
