smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8201212Z <                 <p><strong>Bugfixes</strong></p>
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8201499Z <                 <ul>
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8201824Z <                 <li>Add missing test certs to the sdist distributed on PyPI.</li>
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8202226Z <                 </ul>
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8202464Z <                 <h2>2.32.0 (2024-05-20)</h2>
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8202764Z <                 <p><strong>Security</strong></p>
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8203042Z <                 <ul>
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8203446Z <                 <li>Fixed an issue where setting <code>verify=False</code> on the first request from a
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8204174Z <                 Session will cause subsequent requests to the <em>same origin</em> to also ignore
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8204723Z <                 cert verification, regardless of the value of <code>verify</code>.
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8205713Z <                 (<a href="https://github.com/psf/requests/security/advisories/GHSA-9wx4-h78v-vm56">https://github.com/psf/requests/security/advisories/GHSA-9wx4-h78v-vm56</a>)</li>
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8206421Z <                 </ul>
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8206671Z <                 <p><strong>Improvements</strong></p>
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8206960Z <                 <ul>
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8207323Z <                 <li><code>verify=True</code> now reuses a global SSLContext which should improve
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8207867Z <                 request time variance between first and subsequent requests. It should
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8208530Z <                 also minimize certificate load time on Windows systems when using a Python
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8209219Z <                 version built with OpenSSL 3.x. (<a href="https://redirect.github.com/psf/requests/issues/6667">#6667</a>)</li>
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8209851Z <                 <li>Requests now supports optional use of character detection
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8210388Z <                 (<code>chardet</code> or <code>charset_normalizer</code>) when repackaged or vendored.
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8210962Z <                 This enables <code>pip</code> and other projects to minimize their vendoring
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8211544Z <                 surface area. The <code>Response.text()</code> and <code>apparent_encoding</code> APIs
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8212358Z <                 will default to <code>utf-8</code> if neither library is present. (<a href="https://redirect.github.com/psf/requests/issues/6702">#6702</a>)</li>
smoke (python-poetry)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:02.8212975Z <                 </ul>
