smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2163787Z -                <p><em>Sourced from <a href="https://github.com/django/asgiref/blob/main/CHANGELOG.txt">asgiref's changelog</a>.</em></p>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2165060Z -                <blockquote>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2165831Z -                <h2>3.6.0 (2022-12-20)</h2>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2166321Z -                <ul>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2166663Z -                <li>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2167489Z -                <p>Two new functions are added to the <code>asgiref.sync</code> module: <code>iscoroutinefunction()</code>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2168527Z -                and <code>markcoroutinefunction()</code>.</p>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2169437Z -                <p>Python 3.12 deprecates <code>asyncio.iscoroutinefunction()</code> as an alias for
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2170732Z -                <code>inspect.iscoroutinefunction()</code>, whilst also removing the <code>_is_coroutine</code> marker.
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2172031Z -                The latter is replaced with the <code>inspect.markcoroutinefunction</code> decorator.</p>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2173127Z -                <p>The new <code>asgiref.sync</code> functions are compatibility shims for these
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2174085Z -                functions that can be used until Python 3.12 is the minimum supported
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2185076Z -                version.</p>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2186107Z -                <p><strong>Note</strong> that these functions are considered <strong>beta</strong>, and as such, whilst
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2187313Z -                not likely, are subject to change in a point release, until the final release
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2188344Z -                of Python 3.12. They are included in <code>asgiref</code> now so that they can be
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2189219Z -                adopted by Django 4.2, in preparation for support of Python 3.12.</p>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2189625Z -                </li>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2189837Z -                <li>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2190312Z -                <p>The <code>loop</code> argument to <code>asgiref.timeout.timeout</code> is deprecated. As per other
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2190988Z -                <code>asyncio</code> based APIs, the running event loop is used by default. Note that
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2191606Z -                <code>asyncio</code> provides timeout utilities from Python 3.11, and these should be
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2192290Z -                preferred where available.</p>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2192584Z -                </li>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2192793Z -                <li>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2193150Z -                <p>Support for the <code>ASGI_THREADS</code> environment variable, used by
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2193704Z -                <code>SyncToAsync</code>, is removed. In general, a running event-loop is not
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2194273Z -                available to <code>asgiref</code> at import time, and so the default thread pool
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2195111Z -                executor cannot be configured. Protocol servers, or applications, should set
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2196166Z -                the default executor as required when configuring the event loop at
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2196963Z -                application startup.</p>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2197467Z -                </li>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2197869Z -                </ul>
