smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2786719Z <                 Bumps [asgiref](https://github.com/django/asgiref) from 3.5.2 to 3.6.0.
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2787569Z <                 <details>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2788085Z <                 <summary>Changelog</summary>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2789430Z <                 <p><em>Sourced from <a href="https://github.com/django/asgiref/blob/main/CHANGELOG.txt">asgiref's changelog</a>.</em></p>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2790662Z <                 <blockquote>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2791148Z <                 <h2>3.6.0 (2022-12-20)</h2>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2791502Z <                 <ul>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2791766Z <                 <li>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2792418Z <                 <p>Two new functions are added to the <code>asgiref.sync</code> module: <code>iscoroutinefunction()</code>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2793175Z <                 and <code>markcoroutinefunction()</code>.</p>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2793857Z <                 <p>Python 3.12 deprecates <code>asyncio.iscoroutinefunction()</code> as an alias for
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2794969Z <                 <code>inspect.iscoroutinefunction()</code>, whilst also removing the <code>_is_coroutine</code> marker.
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2795974Z <                 The latter is replaced with the <code>inspect.markcoroutinefunction</code> decorator.</p>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2796722Z <                 <p>The new <code>asgiref.sync</code> functions are compatibility shims for these
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2797256Z <                 functions that can be used until Python 3.12 is the minimum supported
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2797651Z <                 version.</p>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2798138Z <                 <p><strong>Note</strong> that these functions are considered <strong>beta</strong>, and as such, whilst
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2798780Z <                 not likely, are subject to change in a point release, until the final release
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2799335Z <                 of Python 3.12. They are included in <code>asgiref</code> now so that they can be
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2799883Z <                 adopted by Django 4.2, in preparation for support of Python 3.12.</p>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2800267Z <                 </li>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2800480Z <                 <li>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2800936Z <                 <p>The <code>loop</code> argument to <code>asgiref.timeout.timeout</code> is deprecated. As per other
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2801598Z <                 <code>asyncio</code> based APIs, the running event loop is used by default. Note that
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2802199Z <                 <code>asyncio</code> provides timeout utilities from Python 3.11, and these should be
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2802660Z <                 preferred where available.</p>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2803154Z <                 </li>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2803363Z <                 <li>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2803717Z <                 <p>Support for the <code>ASGI_THREADS</code> environment variable, used by
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2804272Z <                 <code>SyncToAsync</code>, is removed. In general, a running event-loop is not
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2805401Z <                 available to <code>asgiref</code> at import time, and so the default thread pool
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2806560Z <                 executor cannot be configured. Protocol servers, or applications, should set
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2807873Z <                 the default executor as required when configuring the event loop at
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2808426Z <                 application startup.</p>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2808852Z <                 </li>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2809070Z <                 </ul>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2809283Z <                 </blockquote>
smoke (python-pip-compile)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-07-25T12:57:21.2809531Z <                 </details>
